commit 5aa7b9f50e9ba8665fab42bc52f5a416c48d5011

C03: identity and capability questions are never clarified away; «cómo funciona esto» names what runs on this PC; the comparison question keeps its subject (IDENTITY1325)

IDENTITY1323 measured three presentation defects. «to quien chuta eres.»: the request reader said identity, but the conversation effect-shape guess (not_complete) rewrote the turn into a football clarification; identity and capability questions now keep their conversation decision. «cómo funciona esto»: a how_it_works presentation shape gives the narrator the served catalog (runs on this PC, can) and rejects a chat-only self-description or a question back. «Tú eres como eso»: the comparison question is retried once when it inverts the subject («te comparas») and rejected if it insists.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


